    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you expand your mind into the future: for 1 hour, you have Advantage on D20 Tests. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest, unless you expend a level 6+ spell slot (no action required) to restore it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-FhkOA4sEMBXA3NgT\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect gives Advantage on ability checks and saving throws; ask for the Advantage on attack rolls.</p></section>",
